  "journal": {
    "s15_journal": {
      "title": "A Divided Council",
      "text": "Emberhold, seat of Veyrath: basalt towers, lava falls and forges that never rest. Lord Kaelen received us in the Ember Hall, and he did not hide his anger that the others began without him. Queen Aveline promised a joint expedition with an open record of every discovery, and Veyrath equal representation. We laid out the evidence: the Sylvaris grove stone, the matching fragments and the map of the six landmarks. Kaelen's house has kept an oath since before Emberhold had walls: keep the Ember Key apart from the door, and never carry it in anger. We dammed the lava channels, lit the oath braziers and opened the vault. Veyrath joins us, cautiously, and the key goes nowhere without Kaelen. Captain Maren's divers have found something at Tidewatch."
